@startuml global-overview

!theme aws-orange
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title Vue Globale - Système de Billetterie

' ========== IMPORTS DES BLOCS ENTITÉ-RELATION ==========

!include core-entities.puml
!include event-entities.puml
!include organizer-entities.puml
!include payment-entities.puml
!include configuration-entities.puml
!include security-entities.puml
!include system-entities.puml

' ========== RELATIONS INTER-MODULES ==========

' Relations User (avec rôles) ↔ Event
User ||--o{ Event : "organise (role=ORGANIZER)"

' Relations Event ↔ Ticket
Event ||--o{ Ticket : "génère"

' Relations Payment ↔ Order
Order ||--o| Payment : "paiement"

' Relations Event ↔ Configuration
Event }o--o| Theme : "thème"

' Relations User ↔ Reviews
Review }o--|| User : "auteur"
Review }o--|| Event : "événement"

' Relations User ↔ Security
UserSession }o--|| User : "sessions"
AuditLog }o--o| User : "audit"
LoginAttempt }o--o| User : "tentatives"

' Relations User ↔ System
ActivityLog }o--|| User : "activités"
Notification }o--|| User : "notifications"

' Relations User ↔ Organization
Organization }o--|| User : "propriétaire (role=ORGANIZER)"
TeamMember }o--|| Organization : "organisation"
TeamMember }o--|| User : "membre"

' ========== LÉGENDE ==========

note bottom
**Architecture avec User multi-rôles :**
• User.role = USER : utilisateur standard
• User.role = ORGANIZER : peut créer des événements et organisations
• User.role = ADMIN : administration système

**Modules :**
• core-entities : User, Order, Ticket (base)
• event-entities : Event, Category, Venue
• organizer-entities : Organization, TeamMember
• payment-entities : Payment
• configuration-entities : Theme, Review, Translation
• security-entities : UserSession, AuditLog, LoginAttempt, BlockedIP
• system-entities : ActivityLog, Notification, SystemBackup
end note

@enduml